        <p>ABS Silk Saris is a contemporary house devoted to authentic Kanchipuram silk. We work with weavers in the temple city — designing, dyeing and weaving most of our silks from scratch, then editing a cherry-picked floor for brides, families and collectors worldwide.</p>
        <h2>Traditional weaving craftsmanship</h2>
        <p>Korvai contrast borders, temple motifs, kattam checks, ganga jamuna and borderless buttas are not trends here; they are grammar. Gold zari is tested. Mulberry silk is chosen for drape and longevity. Each saree is inspected before it leaves the atelier.</p>
        <h2>Authentic silk and zari quality</h2>
        <p>Like the great silk houses of Tamil Nadu, we believe the customer should feel the loom: weight, sheen, and the quiet authority of a well-locked border. Our online atelier exists so a weaver in Kanchipuram can reach a celebration miles away — without compromise.</p>
